# Remotion project for the URDiary intro video — see README.md
node_modules/
out/
# real media (large, produced outside git; see README「素材放哪裡」)
public/media/
# regenerated from desktop/ and public/media/ by scripts/gen-mascot.mjs + scripts/media-manifest.mjs
src/generated/
# Remotion caches (browser download, webpack cache)
.remotion*
# The repo-root .gitignore ignores every lib/ (Python packaging), which also swallowed this project's
# scripts/lib/ (tools.mjs, used by every script) and src/lib/ (anim, camera, fonts, theme, time) — re-include them.
!scripts/lib/
!src/lib/
